#### the_feed_links_both_showcase_entries (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\n:= feed = rss.render_feed \"Spiral Blog\" \"https://i574n.github.io/blog\" (entries ())\n:= article_linked = feed |> sm'.contains \"<link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/showcase/</link>\"\n:= release_linked = feed |> sm'.contains \"<link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/showcase-release/</link>\"\n(article_linked, release_linked) |> _assert_eq (!+, !+)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  := feed = rss.render_feed "Spiral Blog" "https://i574n.github.io/blog" (entries ())
  := article_linked = feed |> sm'.contains "<link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/showcase/</link>"
  := release_linked = feed |> sm'.contains "<link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/showcase-release/</link>"
  (article_linked, release_linked) |> _assert_eq (!+, !+)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### each_tab_keeps_one_showcase_entry (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\n:= articles = entries () |> index.only page.Article |> listm.length\n:= releases = entries () |> index.only page.Release |> listm.length\n(articles, releases) |> _assert_eq (1i32, 1i32)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  := articles = entries () |> index.only page.Article |> listm.length
  := releases = entries () |> index.only page.Release |> listm.length
  (articles, releases) |> _assert_eq (1i32, 1i32)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
